      <title>Introducing Papelon Studio.</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/introducing-papelon/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/introducing-papelon/</guid>
      <description>&lt;!-- coverCaption: &#34;The first light theme by community member trviph&#34; --&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;-about-us&#34;&gt;⌗ About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-green&#34;&gt;3-person&lt;/kbd&gt; board game studio based in the historic island town of &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-yellow&#34;&gt;Visby&lt;/kbd&gt;, Gotland (the very place where we learned to make games). We love collaborating with designers and artists, and above all, we want more people to &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-blue&#34;&gt;play&lt;/kbd&gt; and &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-red&#34;&gt;create&lt;/kbd&gt; games. And that’s why we think &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-pink&#34;&gt;print-and-play&lt;/kbd&gt; is so great!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take a 2 min tour around &lt;kbd&gt;Gotland&lt;/kbd&gt; with us to learn more about our studio and see where we&amp;rsquo;re heading next!!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- We have an issue on the GitHub about the built-in light themes for re-Terminal Hugo Theme, and today I&#39;m glad to introduce the very first light theme made by trviph that is called **Paper**.

You can enable it via config--&gt;</description>
      <content>&lt;!-- coverCaption: &#34;The first light theme by community member trviph&#34; --&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;-about-us&#34;&gt;⌗ About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-green&#34;&gt;3-person&lt;/kbd&gt; board game studio based in the historic island town of &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-yellow&#34;&gt;Visby&lt;/kbd&gt;, Gotland (the very place where we learned to make games). We love collaborating with designers and artists, and above all, we want more people to &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-blue&#34;&gt;play&lt;/kbd&gt; and &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-red&#34;&gt;create&lt;/kbd&gt; games. And that’s why we think &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-pink&#34;&gt;print-and-play&lt;/kbd&gt; is so great!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take a 2 min tour around &lt;kbd&gt;Gotland&lt;/kbd&gt; with us to learn more about our studio and see where we&amp;rsquo;re heading next!!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- We have an issue on the GitHub about the built-in light themes for re-Terminal Hugo Theme, and today I&#39;m glad to introduce the very first light theme made by trviph that is called **Paper**.

You can enable it via config--&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;-the-tour&#34;&gt;⌗ The Tour&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;!-- ROW 1: Framed Image Left | Plain Text Right --&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;games-container&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;game-box game-purple&#34; style=&#34;flex: 0 0 60%; max-width: 60%;&#34; &gt;
        &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/14.jpg&#34; style=&#34;
        max-width: 100%; 
        height: auto; 
        max-height: 360px; 
        object-fit: contain; 
        image-rendering: smooth !important;
      &#34;/&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;flex: 1;&#34;&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;A Rising Tide Lifts all Boats&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;We want to &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-purple&#34;&gt;support&lt;/kbd&gt; emerging, diverse &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-purple&#34;&gt;talent&lt;/kbd&gt; joining the board game &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-purple&#34;&gt;industry&lt;/kbd&gt;. It’s &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-purple&#34;&gt;simple:&lt;/kbd&gt; more diverse game crafters lead to more diverse crafted games &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-purple&#34;&gt;;)&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- ROW 2: Plain Text Left | Framed Image Right (SWAPPED) --&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;games-container&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;flex: 1;&#34;&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;The Hidden Power of PnP&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-yellow&#34;&gt;Print-and-play&lt;/kbd&gt; makes games &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-yellow&#34;&gt;affordable&lt;/kbd&gt;, instantly &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-yellow&#34;&gt;accessible&lt;/kbd&gt; to everyone, and uniquely personal. You don’t just play the game, you spend time &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-yellow&#34;&gt;crafting&lt;/kbd&gt; it, too. Think of it like IKEA: you get the pride of saying, &#39;I made this.&#39; &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-yellow&#34;&gt;Go, go, PnP!&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;game-box game-yellow&#34; style=&#34;flex: 0 0 55%; max-width: 55%;&#34;&gt;
        &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/41.jpg&#34; style=&#34;
        max-width: 100%; 
        height: auto; 
        max-height: 360px; 
        object-fit: contain; 
        image-rendering: smooth !important;
      &#34;/&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- ROW 3: Framed Image Left | Plain Text Right --&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;games-container&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;game-box game-pink&#34; style=&#34;flex: 0 0 55%; max-width: 55%;&#34;&gt;
        &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/36.jpg&#34; style=&#34;
        max-width: 100%; 
        height: auto; 
        max-height: 360px; 
        object-fit: contain; 
        image-rendering: smooth !important;
      &#34;/&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;flex: 1;&#34;&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;Nothing New Under the Sun&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-pink&#34;&gt;Board games&lt;/kbd&gt; are great for having fun, but they can also create a &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-pink&#34;&gt;safe space&lt;/kbd&gt; to foster integration, emotional regulation and cognitive skills. This gives so much &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-pink&#34;&gt;exciting&lt;/kbd&gt; room to explore and create!&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-the-team&#34;&gt;⌗ The Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;game-box game-yellow &#34; style=&#34;flex: 0 0 75%; max-width: 75%; margin-top: 45px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/team.png&#34; style=&#34;
        max-width: 100%; 
        height: auto; 
        max-height: 360px; 
        object-fit: contain; 
        image-rendering: smooth !important;
      &#34;/&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are &lt;kbd&gt;alumni&lt;/kbd&gt; of the Game Design Department at Uppsala University, Campus Gotland. Our team:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ndash; &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-purple&#34;&gt;Majo 🦙 &lt;/kbd&gt;: Peruvian game designer specializing in developing, editing and localizing board games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ndash; &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-blue&#34;&gt;Guido 🧉 &lt;/kbd&gt;: A Biologist from Argentina doing Game Dev in Sweden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ndash; &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-red&#34;&gt;Joel 🦌&lt;/kbd&gt;: From Sweden🫎, always late to meetings, but just to make everyone in the team feel at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Follow our &lt;kbd class=&#34;kbd-green&#34;&gt;Kickstarter&lt;/kbd&gt; to help our studio grow! 🚀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;font-size: 0.9em; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 2rem; line-height: 1.6;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;span style=&#34;display: inline-block; font-size: 1.25em; margin-right: 4px;&#34;&gt;📸&lt;/span&gt;
